    "waitTime": 1600
  },
  {
    "speaker": "記者",
    "text": "それとも──\r\n八雲なみさんのお嬢さんと言った方がいいでしょうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026004030030,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "────ッ──────！！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600403/1026004030030"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "記者",
    "text": "そんなに構えないでください\r\n怪しい者ではございません",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "0454"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "記者",
    "text": "──という出版社で記者をやっております\r\n──と申します。こちら名刺です",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "記者",
    "text": "斑鳩さんと八雲さんのご関係について\r\n記事にさせていただけませんか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "記者",
    "text": "斑鳩さんにとっても\r\n悪いお話ではないと思うんです────",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026004030040,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "（────────ああ、ダメだ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600403/1026004030040"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00967",
    "fg": "007611",
    "bgm": "0315",
    "se": "1002",
    "waitType": "time",
