  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 1026004030050,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "（コイツは何を言ってる？　私とママが何──\r\nいまさらママを引きずり出して、何がしたいってんだよ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600403/1026004030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026004030060,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "（──嫌だ、会わせたくない。会わせられない\r\nこんなヤツを──ママと──！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600403/1026004030060"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "01143",
    "fg": "off",
    "se": "1769",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "middleFg": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "記者",
    "text": "コメティックとして初のワンマンライブを控えた\r\nタイミングですし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "記者",
    "text": "宣伝にはうってつけだと思うのですが……\r\nいかがでしょう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026004030070,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "0000",
    "se": "0327",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600403/1026004030070",
    "autoWaitTime": 1000
